"europe.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fpoland",{"start":114,"end":115,"type":88},{"start":120,"end":121,"type":82,"data":122},212,215,{"link_type":84,"url":123,"target":86},"europe.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fusa",{"start":120,"end":121,"type":88},{"start":126,"end":127,"type":82,"data":128},220,229,{"link_type":84,"url":129,"target":86},"europe.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Faustralia",{"start":126,"end":127,"type":88},"ltr",{"type":76,"text":133,"spans":134,"direction":131},"Whether it’s a present or multiple customer orders, you get tracking included as standard, so you can check your parcel’s progress along the journey.",[],"Send a parcel",{"link_type":84,"key":137,"url":138},"98dfe725-46af-40d7-a6a4-173aef76f66e","europe.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":142,"primary":164,"id":170,"slice_type":171,"slice_label":35},[143,146,149,152,154,157,159,161],{"Col1Content":144,"Col2Content":145},"Cyprus","£8.89",{"Col1Content":147,"Col2Content":148},"France","£8.79",{"Col1Content":150,"Col2Content":151},"Germany","£7.29",{"Col1Content":153,"Col2Content":145},"Greece",{"Col1Content":155,"Col2Content":156},"Italy","£8.69",{"Col1Content":158,"Col2Content":145},"Poland",{"Col1Content":160,"Col2Content":145},"Portugal",{"Col1Content":162,"Col2Content":163},"Spain","£8.59",{"SectionTitle":165,"SectionSubtitle":166,"Col1Header":167,"Col2Header":168,"TableFooter":169,"isTableShort":20},"How much is it to send a parcel to Europe?","When posting to Europe, the price will depend on the weight and destination of your parcel delivery.\n\nWe’ve created a table below on how much it is to send a parcel to some of our most popular European destinations.","Destination","Price","Table prices quoted are for a ParcelShop Standard delivery of a 250g parcel. Quoted on 06\u002F05\u002F2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.","information_table$d41d925b-295e-4d08-8249-751865c2eae3","information_table",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":173,"primary":175,"id":199,"slice_type":200,"slice_label":35},[174],{},{"Image":176},{"dimensions":177,"alt":180,"copyright":35,"url":181,"id":182,"edit":183,"mobile":185,"tablet":192},{"width":178,"height":179},1200,280,"A customer sat on a sofa, holding their tablet and looking at their screen. The display shows the customer is reading about our three easy ways to return a parcel","europe.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1507%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF",{"x":55,"y":184,"zoom":56,"background":57},1507,{"dimensions":186,"alt":180,"copyright":35,"url":189,"id":182,"edit":190},{"width":187,"height":188},343,160,"europe.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C821%2C8192%2C3821&w=343&h=160",{"x":55,"y":191,"zoom":56,"background":57},821,{"dimensions":193,"alt":180,"copyright":35,"url":196,"id":182,"edit":197},{"width":194,"height":195},704,240,"europe.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1336%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":55,"y":198,"zoom":56,"background":57},1336,"photo_block$26dbd7c0-ec98-4b6f-87d6-1f3887c536e7","photo_block",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":202,"primary":219,"id":223,"slice_type":224,"slice_label":35},[203,209,214],{"title":204,"content":205,"isNumbered":206,"icon":207,"image":208},"Book your parcel delivery online using our website or in person at one of our participating Post Office ParcelShops",[],true,{},{},{"title":210,"content":211,"isNumbered":206,"icon":212,"image":213},"Print your postage label at home or at your local ParcelShop with our Print in ParcelShop devices for free",[],{},{},{"title":215,"content":216,"isNumbered":206,"icon":217,"image":218},"Drop off your parcel at your most convenient ParcelShop or Evri Locker or we can collect the parcel from your door if you select our Courier collection service",[],{},{},{"theme":220,"title":221,"description":222,"showPaddingTop":20},"standard","How to send a parcel to Europe","When posting to Europe, you will be asked for information to help get your parcel through customs seamlessly. But don’t worry - we include all this as part of your booking process to make it simple and stress-free for you.\n\nSending parcels from the UK to Europe is easy with Evri. In fact, it only takes three steps:","list_block$cdd5df18-3916-4ff5-9a6d-bc493324fd30","list_block",{"variation":226,"version":31,"items":227,"primary":289,"id":299,"slice_type":300,"slice_label":35},"3Column",[228,250,269],{"Title":229,"Description":234,"Image":238,"Label":35,"UrlText":232,"Url":245,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":248,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[230],{"type":231,"text":232,"spans":233},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[235],{"type":76,"text":236,"spans":237,"direction":131},"Book your delivery online using our website or in selected Post Offices, and drop off your package at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops. If you don’t have a printer at home, just get your postage label using our Print in ParcelShop device for free. Then, hand your parcel over to the store assistant and we’ll take care of the rest.",[],{"dimensions":239,"alt":240,"copyright":35,"url":241,"id":242,"edit":243},{"width":67,"height":68},"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","europe.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":244,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},470,{"link_type":84,"key":246,"url":247},"b74113c0-092e-4986-abb2-2be310a77210","europe.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":249},"Any",{"Title":251,"Description":255,"Image":259,"Label":35,"UrlText":253,"Url":265,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":268,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[252],{"type":231,"text":253,"spans":254},"Lockers",[],[256],{"type":76,"text":257,"spans":258,"direction":131},"We have 24\u002F7 Lockers available across the UK. Head to your nearest location, scan your barcode and place into a secure Locker, ready for collection.",[],{"dimensions":260,"alt":261,"copyright":35,"url":262,"id":263,"edit":264},{"width":67,"height":68},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","europe.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"link_type":84,"key":266,"url":267},"a09509f3-5839-4b5e-9666-85e672894ecc","europe.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":249},{"Title":270,"Description":274,"Image":278,"Label":35,"UrlText":284,"Url":285,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":288,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[271],{"type":231,"text":272,"spans":273},"Courier collection",[],[275],{"type":76,"text":276,"spans":277},"Did you know our Couriers can collect straight from your door? Go online to book a collection from home or work. We’ll give you a one-hour collection window to pick up the parcel.",[],{"dimensions":279,"alt":280,"copyright":35,"url":281,"id":282,"edit":283},{"width":67,"height":68},"A customer has just handed their parcel to an Evri courier as a part of a doorstep collection. The customer is being handed a blue slip as a receipt of the transaction.","europe.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xsZbqstJ9-pVA_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1545.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C8157%2C5441&w=1000&h=667","Z69xsZbqstJ9-pVA",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},"Courier services",{"link_type":84,"key":286,"url":287},"faac1b74-55b9-4040-af56-1f02628ee930","europe.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":249},{"SectionTitle":290,"SectionDescription":295,"theme":35},[291],{"type":292,"text":293,"spans":294},"heading2","Posting to Europe with Evri",[],[296],{"type":76,"text":297,"spans":298},"We’ve made sending your parcels overseas quick and convenient thanks to our three easy options for you to choose from:",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":302,"primary":323,"id":326,"slice_type":327,"slice_label":35},[303,308,313,318],{"title":304,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":305,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Austria",{"link_type":84,"key":306,"url":307},"b1497361-4d7f-4940-ba2e-e64a103bfe3b","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Faustria",{"title":309,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":310,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Belgium",{"link_type":84,"key":311,"url":312},"2cc2b62c-d49e-4062-8125-401c7859eef3","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fbelgium",{"title":314,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":315,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Bulgaria",{"link_type":84,"key":316,"url":317},"ec03dda6-780e-4336-9ae2-1c2703e9645a","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fbulgaria",{"title":319,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":320,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Croatia",{"link_type":84,"key":321,"url":322},"9ff77132-5977-48e8-8932-01b3b522ced6","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fcroatia",{"sectionTitle":324,"sectionDescription":325,"pillEnabled":20,"showPaddingTop":20},"Where does Evri deliver in Europe?","From closer to home in Ireland to as far away as Greece, we deliver all over mainland Europe and beyond. Our network spans six continents, across 200+ countries and territories to make sending parcels to friends or customers easy wherever they are.\n\nWe’ve put together a series of helpful guides on sending packages to some of our most popular European destinations. Whether you’re planning to post for a national holiday, want tips on how to format your recipient’s address, or have questions on what you can and can’t send to certain places - everything you might need can be found here:","feature_link_cards$471f5854-c055-485d-811b-cd0049ee6aae","feature_link_cards",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":329,"primary":349,"id":350,"slice_type":327,"slice_label":35},[330,334,339,344],{"title":144,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":331,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"link_type":84,"key":332,"url":333},"84a872d7-798d-458f-933d-3e4a9f5ee9a8","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fcyprus",{"title":335,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":336,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Czech Republic",{"link_type":84,"key":337,"url":338},"37b9d572-db6d-4eb7-a920-c4c7505fc2ed","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fczech-republic",{"title":340,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":341,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Denmark",{"link_type":84,"key":342,"url":343},"f2ef399e-f3b0-42de-b76c-5123443b8f28","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fdenmark",{"title":345,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":346,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Estonia",{"link_type":84,"key":347,"url":348},"aac97d94-a299-466e-a085-d620485ddc18","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Festonia",{"sectionTitle":35,"sectionDescription":35,"pillEnabled":20,"showPaddingTop":20},"feature_link_cards$0f1d009e-6a46-41a3-a2fe-a3d5b9d644dd",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":352,"primary":370,"id":371,"slice_type":327,"slice_label":35},[